    "rich_text_GbXVUF": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_XhCLHT": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Unleash the Full Potential of Your Chevy Silverado 1500 2019 - 2026</strong>",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "enable_highlight_text_color": true,
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_color": "#56bdc2"
          }
        },
        "text_CfcJd4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Stop worrying about weight limits and start adventuring with confidence. <strong>Offroad Industries (ORI)</strong> offers the most comprehensive, Federally Approved GVM (Gross Vehicle Mass) upgrades for the Chevy Silverado 1500 (LTZ, Trail Boss, and ZR2). </p><p>By bundling the <strong>ORI GVM Packages & </strong> <strong>GCM testing</strong> and the combination of <strong>LS16 certification</strong>, you are offering a legal \"Super-Truck\" status. The <strong>LS16 code</strong> is the secret sauce here: it’s the specific modification code for <strong>Gross Combination Mass Re-rating</strong>, ensuring the truck, the gear, and the massive 4.5T trailer are all </p><p>100% legal together for either PRE or Post Rego</p><p>Whether you’re a weekend explorer, a tradie with a heavy load, or a serious tourer towing a 4.5T caravan, our staged packages transform your truck’s legality, safety, and performance.</p><p>*<strong>Please note that some workshops may apply additional discretionary administration fees to the quoted installation and engineering price. Additionally, all Post-Registration GVM upgrades will incur additional local fees. Shipping is not included in the price.</strong></p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_XhCLHT",
        "text_CfcJd4"
      ],
