        "text_eiTTm6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><em>Increased strength without the cost of replacing all your suspension + legal one tonne payload.</em></p><ul><li><strong>GVM Increase:</strong> 3650 KG.</li><li><strong>Key Features:</strong> Adds <strong>BDS Upper Control Arms</strong> and a leveling kit (or 2\" lift options) retains the factory Multimatic Suspension</li><li><strong>Best For:</strong> Chevy Silverado ZR2 owners only need to clear the \"one-tonne\" mark for tax purposes (ATO compliance) or carry extra tools/gear legally.</li><li><strong>Benefit:</strong> Enhanced front-end strength and wheel travel, ideal for ZR2 owner who retain the OEM suspension yet get 1 tonne payload.</li><li><strong>Part Number:</strong> CHV-1500-Stage2-GVM</li></ul><p></p>"
