        "text_aVwiWh": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><em>Engineered for the ultimate suspension, </em></p><ul><li><strong>GVM Increase:</strong> 3850 KG (approx. 1272 KG payload). GCM Increase 8050 KG ZR2 or 8350 LTZ</li><li><strong>Key Features:</strong> Premium <strong>Fox 2.5 DSC (Dual Speed Compression)</strong> adjustable shocks.</li><li><strong>Best For:</strong> Heavy-duty touring. If you have a bull bar, and a heavy tow ball weight from a large caravan, this is your sweet spot without having to upgrade your wheel and tyre package.</li><li><strong>Benefit:</strong> The DSC adjustability allows you to \"dial in\" your ride—stiffen it for the highway and soften it for the tracks at the turn of a knob. Fox’s premium shocks setup for the Chevy Silverado 1500.</li><li><strong>Part Number: </strong>CHV-1500-Stage3-GVM<br/><br/></li></ul>"
